oh=00_AQQFsnmTx7Ns2pOtiNT4MauMJFGDRzA8OCJaprDxCLxL3Q&oe=6AF72B3F"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1687583032389208", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620504_1687583035722541_7507673610153076124_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O8HrcJ7l5t0Q7kNvwGJ-vQ9&_nc_oc=AdpijBOhwLL3u25plFYPYX8Qn1wZnnap_DKOAnNXo9CrCEY0qU0CygSeNh0kjZ8YzJs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSHFP97ThhmAQTjrg4UrTJb2Y31ojHRp76koCtMeB1R9Q&oe=6AF7484C"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "971804612398133", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620497_971804615731466_8929055800547931018_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LWrJImYrsu0Q7kNvwHad217&_nc_oc=AdpEPZWt1qeNLbk_HK0g491W1gOnELVUf4iavLCD8T8B7sZn0oWiSLg1hWC2G_R4LiI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSAUMNLYnwXWnS7Nk5gpA5nelQhVePymmhzBzuiLORf7A&oe=6AF7201E"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "824590883826843", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310817_824590887160176_5197064716659224950_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WfIlnfy_vOYQ7kNvwHacmhC&_nc_oc=AdqyZN2vuEF_WfyDieQ44BdEzWU_ijp2U7uqQB3DMm-ZpAJ5onU907NO03XE3wf8HE8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSRpIjz5Ea0epZOyvqpkQX2pJYbklsSFXUdQM47MlNoOQ&oe=6AF73B74"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1027497399953684", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499626172_1027497403287017_6826082835293901071_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e-cOCEOY6A4Q7kNvwEPA3GW&_nc_oc=AdpweXhNkrx7Wd_fCjL0rBUqzpq5aTBkbx9aSatgt9Vm80ZWHmXoXxKjLo3mzavp1Wc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTXAUGKU8rGDzlDxuxss6KmwUhi2wJdm1gOQbISXIBP_g&oe=6AF7459F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Beat Blade", "keywords": ["Beat", "Blade", "Rhythm", "Music"], "long_description": "Unleash your inner rhythm master in Beat Blade, the ultimate high-energy VR rhythm action game!\n\nStep into an immersive arcade universe where music meets action. Dual-wield glowing energy blades and slice your way through a dynamic barrage of incoming notes, magical runes, and obstacles\u2014all synced perfectly to a pulse-pounding electronic soundtrack. Whether you are looking for a casual music experience or an intense arcade challenge, Beat Blade delivers a satisfying, full-body VR workout.\nKey Features:\nDual-Blade Action: Feel the rush as you slice, dodge, and conquer the rhythm with precise, physics-based blade controls.\n\nDiverse Track Selection: Choose from an expanding library of intense electronic tracks, with varied lengths and complex note layouts.\n\nCustomizable Runes: Personalize your arcade experience by selecting your target runes, ranging from mystical arcane rings to spooky ghosts and carved Halloween pumpkins.\n\n5 Difficulty Levels: Master your skills across five distinct settings\u2014Apprentice (for beginners), Mage, Sorcerer, Archmage, and Nightmare (for true rhythm game masters).\n\nHigh-Octane Visuals: Immerse yourself in a beautifully stylized neon-dark atmosphere with dynamic lighting and explosive particle effects.\n\nTrack Your Progress: Climb the ranks on each song with integrated performance grades from A to SS.\nAre you ready to test your reflexes and rule the leaderboard? Put on your headset, ignite your blades, and dominate the music in Beat Blade today!", "short_description": "Slice the beat! Dual-wield energy blades in this ultimate VR music rhythm game."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://lucidforgestudios.wixsite.com/lucid-forge-studios", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Lucid Forge Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://lucidforgestudios.wixsite.com/lucid-forge-studios", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534